{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>Staff.</b> Some say that the staff of Levi is not the staff of Elohim, for it had already been recognized, and what need is there to write Aaron's name on it? And some say that the staff was like the rest of the staffs — no difference between them. And this is the right one in my eyes." "And the meaning of <b>for his father's house</b> is the tribes of Israel, such as Reuben and Simeon."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:18:08.380351331Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}